--- !u!114 &406098886
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 406098884}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7a07da11c83865947b4987e5cd652846, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PopupHandler
  _availablePopTexts:
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_1
    Text: I should check the bathroom lights; they might still be on.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_2
    Text: "Another night without working out\u2026 Will I ever manage to stick to
      my workout plan?"
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_3
    Text: 'Note to myself: BUY SOME WINE!'
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_4
    Text: Why do I have such a hard time relaxing?
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_5
    Text: Check the fridge for some leftovers, please Claire.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_6
    Text: Another exhausting lunch break...
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_7
    Text: 'My eye definitely feels weird. Note: get my eyes checked soon.'
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_8
    Text: I think the driving school across the street still has a few spots available.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_9
    Text: Do NOT tell me I'm going to have to wash these pants by hand tonight.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_10
    Text: Breathe Claire. One row at a time. Inhale...
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_11
    Text: "Oh, the never-ending struggle of not becoming an instant pro at every
      new hobby\u2026"
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_12
    Text: Not Wednesday, so... Thursday?
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_13
    Text: I think what I need is someone who can give me instructions on how to get
      proper rest.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_14
    Text: "So I have to think more... in order to think less? That doesn\u2019t make
      any sense."
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_15
    Text: When was my last vacation again? Right, May.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_16
    Text: Me and my cute gloves against the world.
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_17
    Text: Is it ever possible to fully stop thinking?
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_18
    Text: "Anya... she\u2019s the most gentle soul ever. It\u2019s such a shame she\u2019s
      stuck with those jerks at work."
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_19
    Text: "Who\u2019s the cutest kitty cat on Earth? Who is the cutest kitten in
      the WORLD?"
  - DialogueID: Dialogue_20
    Text: "Time flew by so quickly I didn\u2019t even get to finish my scarf..."
  _availablePopupPositions:
  - {fileID: 499380858}
  - {fileID: 1399873008}
  - {fileID: 394011665}
  _prefab: {fileID: 3853628848748752739, guid: 8f0aa4a09553ae04ab50bc49d45e40de, type: 3}
  _transformHolder: {fileID: 1062264704}
